ted-links-545.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=saturday-assorted-links-545">Saturday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/RichardHanania/status/2015063449890681210</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/RichardHanania/status/2015063449890681210</guid><pubDate>Sat, 24 Jan 2026 17:36:26 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[America’s seniors will see a new $6,000 bonus exemption as a part of the Working Families Tax Cut. That’s $93 billion in tax cuts for seniors all over the country.]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1924453133050122240/LnQNgj1x_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Senate Republicans (@SenateGOP) on X</p><p>America’s seniors will see a new $6,000 bonus exemption as a part of the Working Families Tax Cut. That’s $93 billion in tax cuts for seniors all over the country.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/SenateGOP/status/2014386604480331978">https://x.com/SenateGOP/status/2014386604480331978</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/saturday-assorted-links-545.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=saturday-assorted-links-545">Saturday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/SenateGOP/status/2014386604480331978</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/SenateGOP/status/2014386604480331978</guid><pubDate>Sat, 24 Jan 2026 17:36:26 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Moldova merger proceeds?]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G-5GiIbXwAEzdVj.jpg:large"></p><p>Mohammed Soliman (@ThisIsSoliman) on X</p><p>A Romania–Moldova union means a larger country of roughly 21.5 million people and a combined $370B economy, giving Moldova immediate access to the EU market even if per-capita numbers dip at first. It would harden the NATO/EU flank on the Black Sea vis-à-vis Russia.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/ThisIsSoliman/status/2012623646150271247">https://x.com/ThisIsSoli